Defect: SMI-MISSING-IMPORT https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-missing-import

The module uses CLDot11Band as the SYNTAX of an object without naming it
in IMPORTS. CISCO-LWAPP-TC-MIB defines the textual convention and the
clause already imports six other symbols from it.

The repair adds CLDot11Band to that existing FROM group.

--- a/CISCO-LWAPP-AP-MIB
+++ b/CISCO-LWAPP-AP-MIB
@@ -46,7 +46,8 @@
     CLApDot11RadioSubband,
     CLApDot11RadioRole,
     CLApMode,
-    CLApNtpStatus
+    CLApNtpStatus,
+    CLDot11Band
         FROM CISCO-LWAPP-TC-MIB
     cldRegulatoryDomain
         FROM CISCO-LWAPP-DOT11-MIB
